Description: Authentic, native Jagex Launcher for Linux
 Linux Jagex Launcher is an authentic, native desktop launcher built to
 replicate the 1:1 look, feel, and functionality of the official Windows
 and macOS Jagex Launcher for Linux users.
 .
 Features:
  * Native 64-bit ELF execution for RuneScape 3 with zero Wine/Proton overhead.
  * Rootless userspace installation and isolated OpenSSL 1.1 compatibility.
  * Multi-client dock for Old School RuneScape (RuneLite, HDOS, Official Client).
  * One-click launch for RuneScape: Dragonwilds with live Steam RSS patch feeds.
  * Direct Jagex Account OAuth 2.0 PKCE authentication with Turnstile support.
  * Steam Deck & SteamOS handheld controller navigation, 1280x800 layout, and OSK.
